# Frontend

Godot .NET client for {{PROJECT_NAME}}, written in C#.

- `src/Game.Core/` holds game state and rules as plain C#. It does not reference the engine, so it is tested without it.
- `tests/Game.Core.Tests/` holds the xUnit tests for `Game.Core`.
- `game/` is the Godot project. Scenes and nodes live here and call into `Game.Core`.

```bash
dotnet build      # builds every project in Frontend.sln, warnings are errors
dotnet test       # runs the xUnit tests
```

Open `game/project.godot` with the .NET build of Godot to run the game.
